### Family Routes

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Create Family
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/families
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Familia de Prueba"
}

### Get All Families
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/families
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Family by ID
@familyId = {{createFamily.response.body.data.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/families/{{familyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Family
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/families/{{familyId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Familia Actualizada"
}

### Delete Family
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/families/{{familyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
